  "experiment_id": "env-sensors-pilot-001",
  "title": "Environmental Sensor Additionality Pilot 001",
  "description": "Shadow-mode cluster-randomized evaluation of whether including a geo-cohort's sensor data causes a measurable reduction in out-of-sample prediction error (held-out RMSE). The live prediction service is never degraded; a separate evaluation pipeline randomly includes or holds out geographic cohorts across time blocks.",
