      "block_count": "168"
    },
    "effect_definition": "The average change in held-out RMSE for a cohort x time-block caused by including that cohort's signed observations in the training set, relative to the randomized hold-out counterfactual. Estimated at the cohort level only; no individual-device counterfactual is claimed."
  },
  "design": {
